untrusted comment: signature from minisign secret key
PLACEHOLDER_SIGNATURE_HERE
trusted comment: Waymap 0.1.1 by Lauch2
PLACEHOLDER_TRUSTED_COMMENT_HERE

The author must sign waymap-0.1.1.hnmod with their private key and replace
PLACEHOLDER_SIGNATURE_HERE and PLACEHOLDER_TRUSTED_COMMENT_HERE with the actual
signature. The signature follows minisign format: a base64-encoded Ed25519
signature with a comment line first, then a trusted comment line.

To sign properly, use: minisign -s -m waymap-0.1.1.hnmod -S -x > waymap-0.1.1.hnmod.minisig